/** 
Queue: Front(Dequeue) [10 | 20| 30] rear(enqueue)

Header File:
<queue>

(i)Declaration : queue <int> q;
(ii)Insertion: q.push(val)
(iii)Deletion: q.pop()
(iv)Accessing: q.front() 
               q.back()
(v) Size: q.size()
(vi)Traversing: while (!q.empty())
                {
                    cout<<q.front()
                    q.pop()
                }
                
